                  <p class="text-[11px] text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 mt-0.5">${_t('reports.extra_margin_desc', 'Customer paid above expected retail price. Wholesale product cost is 100% covered plus extra profit premium attributed 100% to seller.')}</p>
